---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cuidaty-primary py-14 md:py-20" data-node-id="41:1678">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <!-- Left: copy -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm tracking-wide text-white/85" data-node-id="40:1423">
          Para psicólogos e profissionais da saúde
        </p>
        <h2
          class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-[40px]"
          data-node-id="40:1422"
        >
          O Cuidaty é o aliado que assume o trabalho administrativo para que o profissional possa
          focar no que é essencial: o paciente e a si mesmo.
        </h2>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contato"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-secondary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-secondary/90"
          >
            Experimentar a leveza no meu consultório.
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: photo -->
      <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <div
          class="aspect-[1/1] w-full max-w-[420px] overflow-hidden rounded-[40px]"
          data-node-id="40:1453"
        >
          <Image
            src="/psycologist-taking-coffe.jpg"
            alt="Profissional de saúde"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            width={736}
            height={736}
            loading="lazy"
            format="webp"
            quality={88}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
